## Outcomes & Defensibility
* **100% Audit Readiness:** Achieved compliance with 45 CFR § 164.312(b) (Audit Controls) and transmission security requirements.
* **Hybrid Threat Visibility:** Reduced incident detection windows by aggregating identity logs and endpoint events into single-pane dashboards.
* **Defensible Data Governance:** Established immutable audit logging, ensuring legally sound chain-of-custody tracking for forensic reviews.
